# Restless Spire: "This land enters tapped. {T}: Add {U} or {R}" (CR 614.1c, 605.1a). Bot1 plays it on turn 1: it enters tapped and cannot be tapped for mana (refused). On turn 3 it adds
# blue, and not white or green (refused). On turn 5 it adds red.

[Bot1 Deck]
Restless Spire
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Restless Spire.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Spire.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Spire.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Blue)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Spire.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: White)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Spire.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Spire.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Restless Spire.Activate(Ability: Add; Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {R}
